{
  "id": "s9",
  "wireframe": "s9",
  "title": "Downed, dead and respawn",
  "background": "room-dark",
  "note": "The same HUD as s7: Hud and its nodes are s7's (same names and places); this screen only hides and returns them and adds the downed plates, the dead's room and the protection chip. Aim and the name plates behave as in s7 and are left out here. Every node has mouse_filter IGNORE. Never show who knocked the player down or who killed the player (the engineer, 2026-10-21). The knockdown is kept as decided (GDD §3); spectating left with the MVP: the dead wait in the dead's room (m8 §3; the sketch pages/mvp-screens frame 5 at 0.75, every length x 1.5).",
  "states": [
    { "id": "down", "label": "Нокдаун", "note": "Downed and bleeding out: only the two plates and the mic (off) show; the rest of the HUD hides. As decided, kept." },
    { "id": "down-holding", "label": "Утримуєш F", "note": "The give-up key is held: the hold bar fills over 1 s." },
    { "id": "raise", "label": "Тебе піднімають", "note": "Someone is raising the player: the raise progress replaces the bleed-out bar; giving up hides." },
    { "id": "dead-room", "label": "Кімната мертвих", "note": "Dead (killed, bled out or gave up): the player waits 30 s with the other dead in the dead's room, not watching the living (m8 §3, the sketch's frame 5). The rest of the HUD hides. Open: where the room is; whether the dead can talk to each other there; whether they see the timer and the anger (so no timer and no mic here). No killer is shown (the engineer, 2026-10-21). The return shows small at the top (the engineer, 2026-10-22)." },
    { "id": "back", "label": "Повернення", "note": "Back in the round at a random capsule: the s7 HUD returns with the 3 s protection chip. Stamina returns full: all ten pips lit." }
  ],
